18.3</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-18' index='2' name='fbo-904165-2' data-testid='fillblank-select-904165-2'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-904165-2'></option><option value=\"create\" data-testid='fillblank-option-904165-2-create'>create</option><option value=\"celebrate\" data-testid='fillblank-option-904165-2-celebrate'>celebrate</option><option value=\"damage\" data-testid='fillblank-option-904165-2-damage'>damage</option><option value=\"shorten\" data-testid='fillblank-option-904165-2-shorten'>shorten</option></select></span></strong>&nbsp;our traditions and ensure that they are passed down to future <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>18.4</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-18' index='3' name='fbo-904165-3' data-testid='fillblank-select-904165-3'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-904165-3'></option><option value=\"responsibilities\" data-testid='fillblank-option-904165-3-responsibilities'>responsibilities</option><option value=\"consumers\" data-testid='fillblank-option-904165-3-consumers'>consumers</option><option value=\"generations\" data-testid='fillblank-option-904165-3-generations'>generations</option><option value=\"assignments\" data-testid='fillblank-option-904165-3-assignments'>assignments</option></select></span></strong>.</p>",
